{'symbol': 'CRM', 'date': '2022-12-05 15:05:00', 'title': 'APROMORE ANNOUNCES SERIES B FUNDING BY SALESFORCE AND GBTEC', 'text': 'MELBOURNE, AUSTRALIA--( BUSINESS WIRE )--APROMORE, A LEADING PROVIDER OF VALUE-DRIVEN PROCESS MINING SOFTWARE, TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS SERIES B FUNDING ROUND OF USD $10.3 MILLION (AUD $15.8 MILLION) WITH INVESTMENT FROM SALESFORCE AND GBTEC, A MAIN CAPITAL PARTNERS BACKED COMPANY. IN ADDITION TO THE INVESTMENT, APROMORE HAS ESTABLISHED A PARTNERSHIP WITH SALESFORCE TO PROVIDE TRANSPARENT CONNECTIVITY BETWEEN SALESFORCE CLOUDS AND THE APROMORE PROCESS MINING PLATFORM, LEVERAGING MULESOFT TECHNOLOGY. THE COMBINED SOLUTION ENABLES ORGANIZATIONS TO SEAMLESSLY UNCOVER FRICTION POINTS, BOTTLENECKS, AND OPTIMIZATION OPPORTUNITIES IN THEIR SALES AND SERVICE PROCESSES.'}